# REQUIRED on Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables
# Must be your RAILWAY backend URL (NOT your Vercel URL!)
#
# RAILWAY_BACKEND_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
#
# Rules:
# - Copy URL from Railway → Settings → Networking → Public URL
# - Must start with https://
# - NO trailing slash
# - After adding, REDEPLOY on Vercel
